    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "三十一日，勇贵背着行李，赶到集训的集合点。",
      "sha256": "92ea8839d07c8aa8ba19699d713e392e138aa6e11ab1277b64dabec32d0337ba",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.146,
      "atempo": 1.0292,
      "speech_seconds": 5.0,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.6,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "而勇贵身后的家，三楼的窗，始终暗着。",
      "sha256": "1b5ec27f2e80e11aad8e91375bf4ef00b791cad6a17779ce15361b8e5a4e1bcb",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.624,
      "atempo": 1.0634,
      "speech_seconds": 4.348,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.652
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "要讲清这一天，得回到十二月三十日，那个普通的下午。",
      "sha256": "75e4d78da8eca3fd9009ac59bb69cfeafb07f76173d9229f798b56ef56f42395",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.146,
      "atempo": 0.84,
      "speech_seconds": 6.126,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.59,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.874
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "东京涩谷，这户人家的父母都是牙医，家里一向干净、安静。",
      "sha256": "fe73ed5c13cf6818c59072ebf05eafe81dd829b68408ae36957f76fbca259630",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.348,
      "atempo": 0.9522,
      "speech_seconds": 6.666,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.334
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "长子读牙科，勇贵二十一岁，还在复读备考。",
      "sha256": "099f95361223c5f5f1c55c8ce733aab75782fe4cd1a308cff536c1917d4c7b9f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.956,
      "atempo": 1.2087,
      "speech_seconds": 4.928,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.072
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "妹妹亚澄二十岁，读短期大学，也喜欢表演。",
      "sha256": "a04194d314e776756afdf26832485d888e67a6ee4fda5b7bcf79d1830e76f155",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.937,
      "atempo": 1.0019,
      "speech_seconds": 4.928,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.072
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "三十日下午，母亲和长子拉着行李出门，回福岛过年。",
      "sha256": "ce850c829d8fc2a2511b704575ed38768547bb38bd27f31e2e7fee6c631c627c",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.825,
      "atempo": 0.957,
      "speech_seconds": 6.087,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.913
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "父亲随后也出了门。门一关，家里只剩勇贵和亚澄。",
      "sha256": "5246ce00eccb166c2c4d9f430ae6372d5aab6f02043ffc420b625e41e8283b66",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.139,
      "atempo": 1.0589,
      "speech_seconds": 5.797,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.203
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "门里再没有第三个人。之后的事，只有勇贵的说法。",
      "sha256": "b51b38084bd16c56d2c30b8787a8d4259c006df0f6fec9e2e9f871d4d46349c0",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.538,
      "atempo": 0.9553,
      "speech_seconds": 5.797,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.203
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "勇贵说，争执中，亚澄讲了一句：你没有梦想。",
      "sha256": "b6e98b8a86d4987a10548bc53d27f0a606cb87faa6388e472010f5e5a0301f4e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.538,
      "atempo": 1.1239,
      "speech_seconds": 4.927,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.073
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "那天下午，亚澄在那扇门后遇害。动手的，是亚澄的哥哥。",
      "sha256": "d063fb67b23d3764546a5b59eb7b8dd3ac0b5d507b2f28692b602e75f74267df",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.06,
      "atempo": 0.9504,
      "speech_seconds": 6.377,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.623
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "勇贵关上门，把真相留在屋里。屋里再没有别的声音。",
      "sha256": "04759b08821ea4abd05c2daefad9ab7fc7330634f0c7b67b1a012fc66a1e9f83",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.034,
      "atempo": 0.9913,
      "speech_seconds": 6.087,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.913
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "手机拿起，又放下。勇贵没有报警，也没有离开。",
      "sha256": "f2f1f345e4a76c5c7bda2842404641690293d7521c83e83d3a1b33f5e7710261",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.754,
      "atempo": 0.9112,
      "speech_seconds": 5.218,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.782
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "更反常的，是第二天：勇贵照常起床，照常出门。",
      "sha256": "90f4f12f037765bcfd4401295d33c61f39d99d3fd641e3a981baf55cababee1a",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.008,
      "atempo": 1.2016,
      "speech_seconds": 5.0,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.6,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "十二月三十一日。勇贵收拾行李，准备去集训。",
      "sha256": "d7535fec08da0c3068b8965d9396042b27cb4dc2fbcd4bea670b765eecd0a664",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.545,
      "atempo": 0.8712,
      "speech_seconds": 5.217,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.783
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "勇贵背着包，一个人，走向集合点。",
      "sha256": "0d5ad5621b5e7cb4d85187af5e042e0e4c9cff9c9abbcab4e915a06d34fa708d",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.657,
      "atempo": 0.9705,
      "speech_seconds": 3.768,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.232
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "上车，出发。看上去，和往年没什么两样。",
      "sha256": "be2dcc06e096181a23eb804ef439c3400a87c0cd210df0f8c22eeb2d716d5851",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.258,
      "atempo": 0.9793,
      "speech_seconds": 4.348,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.652
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "而家里的那扇窗，一直暗着。",
      "sha256": "9f08771dd5ea223bbb1c0a972fb3d3cc11231b51456c25bd739f222abb67bd90",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.448,
      "atempo": 1.0815,
      "speech_seconds": 3.188,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.812
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "一月二日，父母和长子结束返乡，回到东京的家。",
      "sha256": "d54352e58f277781b1c638bb0300a490d8ae2771a75454c4dff1446c7e07f553",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.937,
      "atempo": 0.8965,
      "speech_seconds": 5.507,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.493
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "直到三日晚，母亲在走廊停下，闻到一股异味。",
      "sha256": "7fca2400fc3c51560fd88a49992c191618bc0f4e198088a3c8ce972020eeca49",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.355,
      "atempo": 1.0264,
      "speech_seconds": 5.217,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.783
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "母亲走上三楼，停在勇贵的房门前。",
      "sha256": "6aad1ab59bcf7dfb0a0919d21717fcf2f500247eb2c8eff025a7838861d88db1",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.049,
      "atempo": 0.9978,
      "speech_seconds": 4.058,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.942
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "门开了。第二天一早，刑警在集训地找到勇贵。",
      "sha256": "aed04444a4239287d13b7780dcd2dc355817493624d25d4126d3294e9172e23c",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.251,
      "atempo": 1.0501,
      "speech_seconds": 5.0,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.6,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "审讯室里，勇贵先否认，后来承认。争议才刚开始。",
      "sha256": "08b9067feec58d215405db48ecb8b914996f4bcaec949a3f07eed6c82a994461",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.06,
      "atempo": 1.1004,
      "speech_seconds": 5.507,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.493
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "法庭要判断的，不只是勇贵做了什么，还有勇贵当时能不能负责。",
      "sha256": "a200de45eb01cbc19684ee421332d7268a3274f9ca442f8e9db5c95486b2b44c",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.949,
      "atempo": 0.9927,
      "speech_seconds": 7.0,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.71,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "辩方主张，那一刻是另一个人格控制了勇贵。",
      "sha256": "4c137a76cab607acdc7db871bf26be5e37baf0e17f494860fb96dfcf326b2dc0",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.538,
      "atempo": 1.0614,
      "speech_seconds": 5.218,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.782
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "一审七年。杀人罪成立，另一项因责任能力判无罪。",
      "sha256": "af73da1a30f659b1126b0d00dc90041118444df31985d92356091e3d7c069542",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "电影解说体：低沉克制的成熟普通话男声，句子间连贯推进、不逐镜喊口号、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.139,
      "atempo": 1.0589,
      "speech_seconds": 5.797,
      "hanzi_per_second": 3.45,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.203
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
